Essential: yes
Priority: required
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: LeiOS and Debian base system miscellaneous files
 This package contains the basic filesystem hierarchy of a LeiOS system, and
 several important miscellaneous files, such as /etc/debian_version,
 /etc/host.conf, /etc/issue, /etc/motd, /etc/profile, and others,
 and the text of several common licenses in use on LeiOS systems.
 Based on https://salsa.debian.org/sanvila/base-files
